  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Index controller users often have grip interactions to perform animation overrides.\nvrchat often grabs the index controller and simply interacts with the world object by mistake.\nSo I need a grip lock so that I can interact with the object only when I want to.\n(E.g. animation override lock)",
